WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.911
My name is Amlesh. This was my first tournament.

2
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.217
Three days earlier, the tournament hall felt enormous. I had

3
00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:24.671
never played in a place like this before.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.654
Aditya played beside me. Rishi taught me. My parents were

5
00:00:34.654 --> 00:00:39.309
watching. By the final, Aditya would be across the net.

6
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:47.002
I entered both singles and doubles. Every round made the

7
00:00:47.002 --> 00:00:48.883
court feel less unfamiliar.

8
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.846
Rishi had taught me to trust the next shot, even

9
00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:04.443
when I was unsure of the last one.

10
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.995
The semifinal put me opposite Rishi, the person who first

11
00:01:10.995 --> 00:01:12.943
made me want to play.

12
00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:26.071
When the semifinal ended, Rishi smiled first. That made the

13
00:01:26.071 --> 00:01:27.652
win feel different.

14
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:34.147
Aditya and I had reached the doubles final together. Now

15
00:01:34.147 --> 00:01:36.370
he was my singles opponent.

16
00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:46.323
Aditya knew my game better than anyone there. I knew

17
00:01:46.323 --> 00:01:47.208
his, too.

18
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.836
Aditya took the first game. I kept searching for a

19
00:01:56.836 --> 00:01:58.753
way back into the match.

20
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.779
In the second game, I found a rhythm. My feet

21
00:02:07.779 --> 00:02:10.046
moved again, and we were even.

22
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:17.561
Then the cold tightened my legs. The decider began, and

23
00:02:17.561 --> 00:02:20.508
I lost its first six points.

24
00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:39.646
Don't play the match to win; play like you enjoy

25
00:02:39.646 --> 00:02:40.735
the match.

26
00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:58.518
The next return felt like practice. I stopped counting what

27
00:02:58.518 --> 00:02:59.784
I might lose.

28
00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.594
We drew level. Then I moved ahead.

29
00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.212
I won the title.

30
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.409
But what stayed with me was the joy of playing

31
00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:29.800
again.

